WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.735 --> 00:00:03.970
Happy Thanksgiving!

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:05.105
I'm Julie Chrisley

00:00:05.105 --> 00:00:07.707
and cooking has always
been a passion of mine.

00:00:08.208 --> 00:00:09.642
I've had a baking business,

00:00:09.642 --> 00:00:10.610
I've worked in kitchens,

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:13.446
and friends always
ask for my recipes.

00:00:13.446 --> 00:00:14.714
This is your dream come true.

00:00:14.714 --> 00:00:16.516
I mean, you are in your element.

00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:20.086
And this Thanksgiving, I'm
making all my favorite recipes.

00:00:20.086 --> 00:00:22.589
But, can I tell you
how excited I am

00:00:22.589 --> 00:00:24.124
that the kids are
actually going to help?

00:00:24.124 --> 00:00:26.259
Are you actually sure
that this is a good idea?

00:00:26.259 --> 00:00:29.429
I mean, because I would like to have
a Thanksgiving meal that I can eat.

00:00:29.429 --> 00:00:32.032
This year, you all are
gonna be helping me.

00:00:32.032 --> 00:00:32.999
Uh, no!

00:00:32.999 --> 00:00:34.734
I was only invited to eat.

00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:38.304
Who's gonna take the
innards out of the turkey?

00:00:38.304 --> 00:00:39.272
One...Two...Three.

00:00:39.272 --> 00:00:40.273
Get it.

00:00:40.707 --> 00:00:42.108
Oh my god!

00:00:42.342 --> 00:00:44.677
You can't make cornbread
dressing without cornbread.

00:00:44.677 --> 00:00:45.345
Huh?

00:00:45.578 --> 00:00:47.647
Chloe, are you eyeing
these marshmallows, girl?

00:00:47.647 --> 00:00:48.915
Yeah...

00:00:50.283 --> 00:00:52.018
I'm a really chubby bunny.

00:00:52.018 --> 00:00:52.986
Well I believe so.

00:00:53.286 --> 00:00:55.255
Are you not gonna add
a little brandy to this?

00:00:55.255 --> 00:00:56.756
We're not doin'
that with this one.

00:00:57.023 --> 00:00:58.658
It's a napkin, Savannah!

00:00:58.658 --> 00:01:00.093
Oh, I thought that was a placemat.

00:01:01.294 --> 00:01:02.395
MmmMm.

00:01:02.395 --> 00:01:05.098
Now that smells like some
good southern cookin'.

00:01:05.098 --> 00:01:06.766
This looks so good!

00:01:08.034 --> 00:01:09.035
What are you doing?

00:01:09.035 --> 00:01:10.737
I don't know.
I saw it on T.V. once.

00:01:14.374 --> 00:01:16.242
A lot of cooks in this kitchen.

00:01:16.242 --> 00:01:18.011
We gotta say an extra prayer for him.

